    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-03",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or3.9.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "VII. But do ye also, if you bear me any good will—ye who are my husbandry, my vineyard, my own bowels,",
