    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-03",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or3.9.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "or rather His Who is our common Father, for in Christ he hath begotten you through the Gospels—shew to us also some respect.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
