    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-03",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or3.9.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Rather, shew respect for yourselves, and the Image committed to your care, and Him Who committed it, and the Sufferings of Christ, and your hopes therefrom, holding fast the faith which ye have received,",
