    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-03",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or3.9.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and in which ye were brought up, by which also ye are being saved, and trust to save others (for not many, be well assured, can boast of what you can),",
