    "work_id": "npnf-works/gregory-nazianzen-oration-03",
    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or3.9.s7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and reckoning piety to consist, not in often speaking about God, but in silence for the most part, for the tongue is a dangerous thing to men, if it be not governed by reason.",
