    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or3.9.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and for yourselves, worship a little in words, but more by your actions, and rather by keeping the Law than by admiring the Lawgiver;",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
