    "canonical_ref": "GregNaz.Or3.9.s11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "not wood or hay or stubble, weak materials and easily spent when the fire shall try our works or destroy them; but gold, silver, precious stones, which remain and stand.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
